{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative Series & Events</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css" />
</head>
<body class="glass-bg">
<header class="site-header">
<div class="wrap">
<a class="logo" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
<nav class="nav">
<a href="/">Overview</a>
<a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
<a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
<a href="approach.html">Method</a>
<a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
<a href="about.html">Team</a>
<a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
<a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
</nav>
<button id="primary-cta" class="btn primary-cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-inner wrap">
<div class="hero-copy">
<h1>Short courses and guided cycles for whole-life health.</h1>
<p class="lead">We run small, focused series that pair education with actionable planning — a gentle structure that fits busy lives.</p>

<div class="mood-module">
<label for="mood">How are you feeling today?</label>
<select id="mood">
<option value="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed / Scattered</option>
<option value="low_energy">Low energy / Burned out</option>
<option value="stuck">Stuck in old patterns</option>
<option value="recovering">Recovering from setback</option>
<option value="curious">Curious / Exploring</option>
</select>

<div id="method-recommendation" class="method-card">
<h3 id="method-title">Personalized Intro Series</h3>
<p id="method-desc">A short guided track to clarify priorities, stabilize routines, and set a three-stage plan.</p>
<a id="mood-cta" class="btn cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?source=mood">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="mini-timeline">
<div class="phase">Phase 1: Align — short assessment + focal sessions</div>
<div class="phase">Phase 2: Stabilize — daily practices and group check-ins</div>
<div class="phase">Phase 3: Integrate — maintenance planning and resources</div>
<p class="disclaimer">Educational program — not a replacement for medical care.</p>
</div>

</div>

<div class="hero-pattern">
<img src="assets/img/pattern.svg" alt="" />
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section class="social-proof wrap">
<h2>Participants say it feels like a practical reset</h2>
<blockquote>“The three-week cycle gave me something clear to do every morning — small, manageable changes that actually stuck.” — M., participant</blockquote>
<blockquote>“A realistic rhythm for busy people. No fads, just doable guidance.” — S., participant</blockquote>
</section>

<section class="benefits wrap">
<h2>Why this format?</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Time-smart:</strong> Short series with targeted learning and tools you can use immediately.</li>
<li><strong>Community-led:</strong> Small cohorts for accountability and learning together.</li>
<li><strong>Action-first:</strong> Each week focuses on a single, measurable shift.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="process wrap">
<h2>Roadmap: 3 Phases (planner)</h2>
<p class="intro">Use the planner to sketch a realistic three-phase path. Click a phase to expand details.</p>

<div id="timeline" class="timeline">
<div class="node" data-phase="1">
<h3>Phase 1 — Clarify</h3>
<p class="summary">Assess symptoms, routines, and priorities. Set 1–2 concrete goals.</p>
<button class="toggle">Details</button>
<div class="details hidden">
<ul>
<li>Initial intake & baseline</li>
<li>Short teaching modules</li>
<li>Daily micro-practices</li>
</ul>
<p class="disclaimer">This is educational support and not individualized medical treatment.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="node" data-phase="2">
<h3>Phase 2 — Stabilize</h3>
<p class="summary">Establish sustainable habits and peer accountability.</p>
<button class="toggle">Details</button>
<div class="details hidden">
<ul>
<li>Guided habit sessions</li>
<li>Group Q&amp;A and adjustments</li>
<li>Tools for progress tracking</li>
</ul>
<p class="disclaimer">If symptoms are severe, consult a clinician.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="node" data-phase="3">
<h3>Phase 3 — Maintain</h3>
<p class="summary">Build a long-term maintenance plan and resource kit.</p>
<button class="toggle">Details</button>
<div class="details hidden">
<ul>
<li>Refinement of routines</li>
<li>Relapse prevention strategies</li>
<li>Resource handoff for ongoing support</li>
</ul>
<p class="disclaimer">Not a medical prescription; seek clinical guidance for complex conditions.</p>
</div>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="faq wrap">
<h2>Questions people ask</h2>
<details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. These are educational series designed to teach practical methods. They are not a substitute for therapy or urgent medical care.</p></details>
<details><summary>How long is each series?</summary><p>Most series run 3–6 weeks with weekly live sessions and daily prompts.</p></details>
</section>

<section class="cta wrap">
<h2>Ready to try a guided cycle?</h2>
<p>Choose a short series that matches your current state and reserve a spot.</p>
<a id="final-cta" class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
</section>

</main>

<footer class="site-footer wrap">
<div>
<p>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
</div>
</footer>

<script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"}
